<title>LEBANON: Solidere shares mixed in Beirut.</title>
<headline>Solidere shares mixed in Beirut.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Solidere shares were mixed on the Beirut Stock Exchange on Tuesday as A shares fell to $108.5 from Monday's $109.25 and B shares held steady at $114.</p>
<p>Turnover in Solidere shares fell to 3,653 shares from 5,628 and value was $405,671 from $624,212 a day earlier.</p>
<p>There was no trade in the shares of the four other listed companies: Ciments Libanais, Ciments Blancs, Eternit and Uniceramic.</p>
<p>The LISPI stock index fell 0.11 percent to 81.29 and the BLOM stock index also fell 0.31 percent to 932.89.</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (9611) 353078 645456 602057</p>
</text>
